testValueApiBatch3;req;r;vi32;vf32;vdbl;x;tol;s;parsed;floatVals;doubleVals
⍝ Isolated runtime test for Value API batch 3 scalar getters.

:If 0=⎕NC'null'
    init 'lib/'
:EndIf

req←{0::⍺,' - FAILED: ',⎕DMX.Message ⋄ ⍵:⍺,' - OK' ⋄ ⍺,' - FAILED'}
r←⊂'Test Value API Batch 3'

vi32←createInt32Value 123
r,←⊂'createInt32Value handle' req vi32≠0
r,←⊂'valueType(int32)=INTEGER' req type.INTEGER=valueType vi32
r,←⊂'getInt32Value returns 123' req 123=getInt32Value vi32
{}destroyValue vi32

floatVals←0 1.25 ¯2.5 12345.125
:For x :In floatVals
    vf32←createFloatValue x
    r,←⊂'createFloatValue handle' req vf32≠0
    :If vf32≠0
        tol←1E¯5⌈1E¯6×|x
        r,←⊂'valueType(float)=FLOAT' req type.FLOAT=valueType vf32
        r,←⊂'getFloatValue close to source' req tol>|x-getFloatValue vf32
        r,←⊂'getDoubleValue(float) close to source' req tol>|x-getDoubleValue vf32
        s←getVarcharValue vf32
        :Trap 0
            parsed←⍎s
            r,←⊂'getVarcharValue(float) parses to number' req tol>|x-parsed
        :Else
            r,←⊂'getVarcharValue(float) parses to number' req 0
        :EndTrap
        {}destroyValue vf32
    :EndIf
:EndFor

doubleVals←0 1.25 ¯2.5 3.141592653589793
:For x :In doubleVals
    vdbl←createDoubleValue x
    r,←⊂'createDoubleValue handle' req vdbl≠0
    :If vdbl≠0
        tol←1E¯12⌈1E¯12×|x
        r,←⊂'valueType(double)=DOUBLE' req type.DOUBLE=valueType vdbl
        r,←⊂'getDoubleValue close to source' req tol>|x-getDoubleValue vdbl
        s←getVarcharValue vdbl
        :Trap 0
            parsed←⍎s
            r,←⊂'getVarcharValue(double) parses to number' req tol>|x-parsed
        :Else
            r,←⊂'getVarcharValue(double) parses to number' req 0
        :EndTrap
        {}destroyValue vdbl
    :EndIf
:EndFor

⎕←↑r
⎕←''
⎕←'Value API batch 3 runtime testing complete!'

⍝ KSL 1.0.0
